\dfrac{b+c}{\sin B + \sin C} &= \dfrac{b+c}{\dfrac 52 \left(\dfrac 1b + \dfrac 1c \right)} 
&= \dfrac{b+c}{\dfrac 52 \left(\dfrac{b+c}{bc}\right)} 
